              [ Apply Now ]
            </p>
            <h2 class="font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-dark-foreground text-h2 mb-6" data-ps="src/pages/employment.astro:mb9vx3">
              KRE Employee Application
            </h2>
            <p class="font-sans text-dark-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8" data-ps="src/pages/employment.astro:fiw162">
