                    <span class="text-dark-muted-foreground text-xs" data-ps="src/pages/employment.astro:d0vp4p">Monday to Friday, 9 AM – 6 PM. Just stop in.</span>
                  </p>
                  <p data-ps="src/pages/employment.astro:fiw168"><span class="text-primary font-bold" data-ps="src/pages/employment.astro:d0vp4o">Mail to:</span><br />
                    KRE Security LLC.<br />
                    Attn: Employment<br />
                    16600 Pottsville Pike<br />
                    Hamburg, PA 19526
